# M46 Execution Changes Log — i18n, Weekly States, Profile Accordions, History Modal & Notifications

Autonomous sprint following the strict TDD loop per task: failing tests →
implementation → targeted tests → backlog check-off → git commit, followed by a
full `fvm flutter analyze` and full `fvm flutter test`. Verification used the
project's pinned FVM SDK (Flutter 3.29.0).

## Task 1: Complete i18n Sweep
- `lib/core/domain/i18n/app_strings.dart` (+ English/Spanish) — added
  `weeklyMacrosTitle`, `settingsTitle`, `notificationsSectionTitle`,
  `savedRecordsTitle`, `noSavedRecords`, `notificationPreferencesTitle`,
  `exerciseAlertsLabel`, `foodAlertsLabel`, `dailyIntakeRemindersLabel`,
  `deleteRecordTitle`, `editFocusTitle`, `focusAreaLabel`,
  `nightlyCheckInTestButton`, `quickTestTitle`, `removeExerciseTooltip`.
- `lib/ui/pages/settings_page.dart` — every hardcoded label/dialog prompt now
  resolves through `LocalizationScope.stringsOf(context)` (English defaults
  preserved so existing English assertions stay valid).
- The full-coverage probe now renders the new getters.
- Tests: `test/features/m46_settings_i18n_test.dart` (English defaults, Spanish
  labels, localized delete dialog); `test/i18n/full_coverage_test.dart` and
  `test/features/m10_settings_widget_test.dart` stay green.

## Task 2: Weekly States Fix (Nutrition & Workouts)
- `lib/core/models/weekly_stat.dart` — `WeeklyStat` gained `protein`, `carbs`
  and `fat`; `lib/core/utils/weekly_stats.dart` fills them from each
  `DailyEntry`.
- `lib/ui/organisms/weekly_stats_sheet.dart` — new localized "Weekly macros"
  totals row (`weekly_protein_total`, `weekly_carbs_total`, `weekly_fat_total`).
- `lib/ui/pages/nutrition_page.dart` — food logged on the Nutrition tab now
  upserts today's `DailyEntry` (calories + macros accumulated), so the Weekly
  Stats and calendar reflect consumed food. This is the root cause of the
  missing consumed-calorie summation.
- `lib/core/state/workout_completion_controller.dart` — new
  `removeExercise(name)` removes one completion, persists the remainder and
  re-syncs today's calendar entry (exercise names + burned calories).
- `lib/ui/molecules/routine_summary_sheet.dart` — per-exercise delete control
  (`routine_delete_<name>`) wired through the completion controller plus a
  blueprint refresh; `routines_page.dart` passes the completion controller.
- Tests: extended `test/utils/weekly_stats_test.dart`, plus
  `m46_weekly_stats_macros_test.dart`, `m46_nutrition_persistence_test.dart`,
  `m46_routine_exercise_deletion_test.dart`.

## Task 3: Profile Accordion Sections (Symptoms & Settings)
- `lib/ui/molecules/accordion_section.dart` — reusable collapsible section:
  smooth `AnimatedSize` body + rotating chevron; the body is removed from the
  tree while collapsed.
- `lib/ui/molecules/settings_panel.dart` — notification preference toggles
  (`settings_toggle_*`).
- `lib/ui/pages/profile_page.dart` — Daily Symptoms accordion
  (`profile_symptoms_accordion`, embeds `SymptomTracker`) and Settings accordion
  (`profile_settings_accordion`).
- Wiring: `main_shell_page.dart` forwards the symptom controller, prefs store
  and notification service; `app.dart` creates the shared
  `NotificationPrefsRepository` (SQLite or mock).
- Tests: `test/ui/accordion_section_test.dart`,
  `test/features/m46_profile_accordions_test.dart`.

## Task 4: Notifications & Test Trigger
- `lib/core/services/notification_service.dart` — `nightlyCheckInTestId` (3302)
  and `showNightlyCheckInTest()` that immediately presents the rich nightly
  check-in with its icon actions.
- `lib/ui/pages/nutrition_page.dart` — `nightly_check_in_test_button` in the
  notifications section.
- `lib/ui/molecules/settings_panel.dart` — Profile settings quick-test triggers
  (`settings_nightly_test_button`, `settings_exercise_not_button`).
- Tests: `test/features/m46_notification_triggers_test.dart` (service-level
  platform capture + Nutrition and Profile trigger widgets).

## Task 5: Centralized History Popup & Calendar Header Adjustments
- `lib/ui/molecules/calendar_month_header.dart` — shared clean month header:
  centered month label in a subtle pill flanked by circular navigation buttons
  (`calendar_month_pill`).
- `lib/ui/organisms/calendar_history_dialog.dart` — `showCalendarHistoryDialog`
  now uses `showDialog` (centered modal, max width 440) instead of a bottom
  sheet; the day editor is also a centered dialog. Stable keys preserved
  (`calendar_history_dialog`, `calendar_day_*`, `history_*`, `history_month_label`).
- `lib/ui/pages/schedule_page.dart` — calendar uses the shared month header.
- Tests: `test/features/m46_centralized_history_test.dart`; existing M27/M31/M36/
  M42/M43 history and calendar tests remain green.

